#ASSERT `Is the acknowledgment requirement satisfied for this instrument` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the acknowledgment requirement satisfied for this instrument` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
